return ['domain'=>'zinn-migrate','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'so_SO','project-id-version'=>'zinn-migrate','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-25T19:15:51+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-25T19:15:51+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Migrate'=>'Zinn® Migrate','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-migrate'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-migrate','Packages this WordPress site — files and database — into one archive that Zinn Digital® can pull in, for hosts we cannot reach any other way. Install it on the site you are LEAVING, press one button, and paste the link into your Zinn® migration.'=>'Waxay ku duubaysaa boggaygan WordPress — faylasha iyo xogta kaydka — hal kayd oo Zinn Digital® ay soo jiidan karto, martigeliyayaasha aan si kale ku gaari karin. Ku rakib goobta aad ka Tagayso, riix hal badhan, oo ku dheji xiriirinta hijradaada Zinn®.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Move this site to Zinn®'=>'U raraykan mareegta Zinn®','Move to Zinn®'=>'U raji Zinn®','You do not have permission to do this.'=>'Ma haysatid ogolaansho aad arrintan ku samayso.','This packages everything on this site — its files and its database — into one archive, and gives you a private link to it. Paste that link into your migration on Zinn® and we will pull the site across. Nothing here is sent anywhere until you choose to share the link.'=>'Tani waxay wax walba oo ku jira boggan — faylasha iyo xog-ururintiisa — ku ururinaysaa hal kayd, waxayna ku siinaysaa xiriirin gaar ah. Xiriirintaas ku dheji raristaada Zinn® waana soo jiidi doonaa bogga. Wax halkan ku jira lama diro meelna ilaa aad doorato inaad la wadaagto xiriirinta.','You may not need this. If your old host gives you FTP, SSH, cPanel, Plesk or DirectAdmin, Zinn® can fetch the site directly with those details and you can skip this plugin entirely — it is faster and there is nothing left behind afterwards. Use this when none of those are available to you.'=>'Waxaa laga yaabaa inaadan tan u baahnayn. Haddii martigeliyahaagii hore uu ku siiyo FTP, SSH, cPanel, Plesk ama DirectAdmin, Zinn® ayaa si toos ah u soo qaadan kara goobta iyadoo la adeegsanayo xogtaas, waadna ka boodi kartaa plugin-kan gebi ahaanba — way ka dhakhso badan tahay, mana jiraan wax ka hara kadib. Isticmaal tan marka midkoodna aadan heli karin.','Room on this server'=>'Booska server-kan','This server will not tell us how much disk space is free, so we cannot check for you. The package needs roughly %s. If you are not sure there is that much room, ask your host before you build it — a server that runs out of space mid-way takes the site down.'=>'Adeeggan ma sheegayo inta boos ee diskiga ah ee bilaashka ah, markaa ma hubin karno adiga. Xirmada waxay u baahan tahay qiyaastii %s. Haddii aadan hubin inuu jiro boos intaas le\'eg, weydii martigeliyahaaga ka hor inta aadan dhisin—server ka dhammaada booska bartamaha wuxuu dejiyaa bogga.','The package needs roughly %1$s and this server has %2$s free.'=>'Baakaddu waxay u baahan tahay qiyaas ah %1$s oo server-kani wuxuu leeyahay %2$s oo lacag la\'aan ah.','Build the package'=>'Dhis xirmada','Building…'=>'Waa la dhisayaa…','Now packaging: %1$s. %2$s files so far, %3$s written.'=>'Hadda la baakadaha: %1$s. %2$s faylal ilaa hadda, %3$s ayaa la qoray.','your files'=>'faylashaada','your database'=>'kaydkaaga xogta','Continue'=>'Sii wad','Cancel and delete'=>'Jooji oo tirtir','Your package is ready'=>'Xirmadaadu waa diyaar','Copy this link and paste it into your migration on Zinn®:'=>'Koobi xiriirkan oo ku dheji haajiraddaada Zinn®:','Size: %s.'=>'Cabirka: %s.','Treat this link like a password. Anyone who has it can download your whole site, including your database. We delete the package automatically 24 hours after it was built — delete it yourself as soon as your migration has finished.'=>'Xiriirkan ula dhaqaa sidii erayga sirta ah. Qof kasta oo haysta wuxuu soo dejisan karaa bartaada oo dhan, oo ay ku jirto xog-ururintaada. Waxaan si toos ah u tirtirنا xirmada 24 saacadood kadib markii la dhisay - naftaada u tirtir isla marka ay tahay migration-kaagu dhammaato.','Delete the package now'=>'Hadda tirtir xirmada','Build it again'=>'Dib u dhis mar kale','This server does not have PHP’s ZipArchive extension, so we cannot build a package here. Ask your host to enable it, or use the migration form on Zinn® with your FTP or SSH details instead.'=>'Kumbuutarkan garab-kareeedku ma laha kordhinta ZipArchive ee PHP, markaas ma dhisi karno xirmo halkaan. Ka codso martigeliyahaaga inuu shido, ama isticmaal foomka soo-haajiridda ee Zinn® oo wata tafaasiishaada FTP ama SSH halkaas.','We could not create a folder inside your uploads directory, so there is nowhere to write the package. Check that wp-content/uploads is writable.'=>'Waanu abuuri kari waynay faylal galkaaga soo gelinta ah, markaa ma jiro meel lagu qoro xirmada. Hubi in wp-content/uploads la qori karo.','There is no package being built. Start one first.'=>'Ma jiro xirmo la dhisayo. Mid billow marka hore.','We could not open the package file for writing.'=>'Ma aynaan awoodin inaan furno faylka xirmada si loo qoro.','We could not write the database export.'=>'Waanu awoodin waynay inaan qorno keydka xogta ee la dhoofiyay.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — hagayaasha iyo adeegyada','User guides'=>'Hagayaasha isticmaalaha','Read the %s user guide'=>'Akhri hageha isticmaalaha ee %s','Hide this'=>'Qari tan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Zinn® hosting for WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, kaydinta maalinlaha ah, haajiradda bilaashka ah iyo guddiga maamulka ee loogu talagalay dadka wada in ka badan hal mareeg.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Suuqa Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Iibso oo iibi shabakadaha la aas-aasay, domain-yada iyo meelaha xiriirinta, iyadoo lacagta si ammaan ah loo hayo ilaa labada dhinac ay ka qanacayaan.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — kireyso dadkan shaqadan u leh noloshooda','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Suuqa caalamiga ah ee xorta ah: ka baadh in ka badan 10,000 adeeg oo diyaar ah oo ka yimid qorayaasha, naqshadeeyayaasha, horumariyayaasha iyo khubarada SEO, ama soo dhig mashruuc oo u ogolow inay ku tartamaan.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Ka eeg qoraallada sii-daynta ee Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Cusboonaysiintii la soo dejiyay waa ay ku guuldareysatay baaritaanka daacadnimadeeda mana aysan rakibin.']];